  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- PDChat: the input toolbar and header are restyled (#274). Font Awesome icons replace the emoji, set through the new PDChatIcons record on PDChat.Icons and PDMessages.Icons, so a host can use another icon set. Every picker and button is one height, the voice button and its mode select are one split control, the answering model is a badge after the model picker, and the header's dock and unpin buttons are one pin toggle. Narrower than 860px, the toolbar takes two rows with Send on the right. New --pd-chat-* CSS variables theme the toolbar, Send, the voice states and the header, and can be set on :root or a theme class. Send is now btn-primary rather than btn-secondary.",
